<roster id="c4qiypr" name="hos-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="6190" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="ci3psww" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="afdb-68a1-283e-3bf2" catalogueRevision="34" catalogueName="Hedonites of Slaanesh"><selections><selection id="n4c24n" name="Exalted Chariot" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::08e6-7dfb-f60e-6fc0" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="aac7-799b-b28e-2190" name="Exalted Chariot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">9</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e5cf-5a69-cd18-5649" name="Excess of Blades" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the unmodified charge roll for that **^^Charge^^** ability. For each roll that exceeds the target's Save characteristic, the target suffers 1 mortal damage.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="n52xdz" name="Exalted Chariot" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::ab60-d913-fb45-0775" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="n6k1stp" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::76e9-71da-06c5-3ac2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ab85-0854-d758-52c0" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="n6ya9zf" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::e8d7-b59b-871c-3ae5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bca3-b168-e166-8ff5" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="(No Category)" entryId="(No Category)" name="Uncategorized" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="n5onq5" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="n9s9amv" name="Battle Traits" entryId="9eab-ba5b-5d29-3c72::77b8-2e38-40f0-4472" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="af6b-eaf5-fd60-e7a7" name="Paragons Of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Your Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If there are fewer than 3 friendly **^^Paragons^^** on the battlefield, pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit that does not have the **^^Paragon^^** keyword and has not had the **^^Paragon^^** keyword this battle to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target gains the **^^Paragon^^** keyword.


**Designer's Note**: *Friendly units with the* **^^Paragon^^** *keyword on their warscroll count towards the number of friendly* **^^Paragons^^** *on the battlefield. If there are more than 3 friendly* **^^Paragons^^** *on the battlefield at the same time, you must immediately remove those units from the battlefield one at a time until there are only 3 friendly* **^^Paragons^^** *left on the battlefield.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4c49-c1fa-646a-6b88" name="Fall From Grace" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">A friendly non-**^^Unique Paragon^^** immediately loses the **^^Paragon^^** keyword when any of the following happen:

• That **^^Paragon^^** has 3 or more damage points allocated to it by the same use of a non-**^^Attack^^** ability.
• That **^^Paragon^^** uses a **^^Charge^^** ability and the unmodified charge roll is 5 or less (after any re-rolls).
• A spell cast by that **^^Paragon^^** is **miscast** (after any re-rolls).</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ae84-02bd-9934-bfd7" name="Sensuous Arcana" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Unique Paragon^^** that has successfully cast a spell this turn and has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn to use this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Until the start of your next turn, while the unit using this ability is a **^^Paragon^^**, add 1 to casting rolls for visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of the unit using this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="39b4-854c-9c7a-e1b2" name="Excess Of Agility" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Unique Paragon^^** that has not use a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn to use this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, while the unit using this ability is a **^^Paragon^^** and is in combat, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of the unit using this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="05f7-ba73-4ff6-5228" name="Enthralling Vanity" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Hero^^** unit that has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn to use this ability. Then, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of that **^^Hero^^** to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the unit using this ability is a **^^Paragon^^** pick 1 of the effects below. Otherwise your opponent must pick 1 of the effects below.


***Mesmerized:*** For the rest of the turn, weapons used by friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units for attacks that target that unit, including **Companion** weapons, have **Crit (2 Hits)**.


***Break their Gaze***: For the rest of the turn, other than the **Companion** ability, weapon abilities for combat attacks made by the target have no effect.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="78f4-6a83-e019-a0e9" name="Beguiling Glance" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Shooting Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Hero^^** unit that has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn to use this ability. Then, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of that **^^Hero^^** to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the unit using this ability is a **^^Paragon^^**, pick 1 of the effects below. Otherwise, your opponent must pick 1 of the effects below.


***Succumb:*** For the rest of the turn, when the target is using a **^^Charge^^** ability, it must end that charge move no further from the **^^Hero^^** using this ability.


***Resist:*** For the rest of the turn, subtract 2 from charge rolls for the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e5c9-7f2e-fcd5-baf5" name="Chief Of Revels" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Unique Paragon^^** that charged this turn and has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn to use this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Until the start of your next turn, while that unit using this ability is a **^^Paragon^^**, add 2 to charge rolls for friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of the unit using his ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3c8d-6cc1-bda2-0dfe" name="Cutting Barbs" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Hero^^** that has not use a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn to use this ability. Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with that **^^Hero^^** to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the unit using this ability is a **^^Paragon^^**, pick 1 of the effects below. Otherwise,  your opponent must pick 1 of the effects below.


***Rise to the Insults:*** For the rest of the turn, the target has a maximum control score of 1.


***Turn Aside from the Insults:*** For the rest of the turn, add 1 to the hit rolls for attacks made by friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units that target that enemy unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="e1s1xoe" name="Battle Formation" entryId="9fe3-ad15-6800-71f7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="ndjwzxf" name="Battle Formation" entryId="9fe3-ad15-6800-71f7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="e93i5y" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="nn9wbo" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="efsl4v" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="24b9-572f-300a-f410" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="nssvbp" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="24b9-572f-300a-f410" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="emcaml3m" name="Spell Lore" entryId="24b6-2275-f051-2a24" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="enevlol" name="Lore of Extravagance" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::c085-6e5e-a0ce-fb46" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::a0dd-82b8-8dcd-c15a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="eqn6lsj" name="Hysterical Frenzy" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::6239-cfbb-c6ac-c762" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::a740-8833-9146-5ead" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Extravagance"><profiles><profile id="90b7-4f61-a98c-ffc1" name="Hysterical Frenzy" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /><attribute name="Type" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ep0anuc" name="Last Ecstasy" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::43cf-5ae5-4f8b-79c0" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::a740-8833-9146-5ead" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Extravagance"><profiles><profile id="a251-5fee-b20e-1402" name="Last Ecstasy" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time a modoel in the target unit is slain by a combat attack and that model was in combat with the attacking unit, roll a dice. If the target unit is a **^^Monster^^**, roll 10 dice instead. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="eqmfwq" name="Overwhelming Acquiescence" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::3627-4b2a-6812-1b25" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::a740-8833-9146-5ead" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Extravagance"><profiles><profile id="4e7-3bd0-b982-e2ac" name="Overwhelming Acquiescence" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Unit the start of your next turn, weapons used by friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units for attacks that target that enemy unit, including **Companion** weapons, have **Crit (2 Hits)**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="o3ia42" name="Spell Lore" entryId="24b6-2275-f051-2a24" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="o3pmch" name="Lore of Extravagance" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::c085-6e5e-a0ce-fb46" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::a0dd-82b8-8dcd-c15a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="o40p5w" name="Hysterical Frenzy" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::6239-cfbb-c6ac-c762" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::a740-8833-9146-5ead" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Extravagance"><profiles><profile id="90b7-4f61-a98c-ffc1" name="Hysterical Frenzy" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /><attribute name="Type" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="o4vvgpn" name="Last Ecstasy" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::43cf-5ae5-4f8b-79c0" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::a740-8833-9146-5ead" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Extravagance"><profiles><profile id="a251-5fee-b20e-1402" name="Last Ecstasy" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time a modoel in the target unit is slain by a combat attack and that model was in combat with the attacking unit, roll a dice. If the target unit is a **^^Monster^^**, roll 10 dice instead. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="o4sqjsg" name="Overwhelming Acquiescence" entryId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::3627-4b2a-6812-1b25" entryGroupId="938e-c4bb-ca41-33e9::61ef-4dea-20a3-f346::a740-8833-9146-5ead" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Extravagance"><profiles><profile id="4e7-3bd0-b982-e2ac" name="Overwhelming Acquiescence" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Unit the start of your next turn, weapons used by friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units for attacks that target that enemy unit, including **Companion** weapons, have **Crit (2 Hits)**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="eszx5i4" name="Fane of Slaanesh" entryId="a080-ae8d-69c-3193::bad2-41cf-b054-d9b3" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="f39f-bd91-532b-999" name="Fane of Slaanesh" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="c0aa-df5e-6df8-f65d" name="Damned Conduit" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this terrain feature to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn while the target is within x&quot; of this terrain feature, the target's weapons have the **Companion** weapon ability, where X is determined by the current battle round as follows:


**Battle Round 1:** 9&quot;
**Battle Round 2:** 12&quot;
**Battle Round 3:** 15&quot;
**Battle Round 4:** 18&quot;
**Battle Round 5:** 21&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6f47-50f1-1e37-8e67" name="Fane of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="o9oa309" name="Fane of Slaanesh" entryId="a080-ae8d-69c-3193::bad2-41cf-b054-d9b3" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="f39f-bd91-532b-999" name="Fane of Slaanesh" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="c0aa-df5e-6df8-f65d" name="Damned Conduit" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this terrain feature to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn while the target is within x&quot; of this terrain feature, the target's weapons have the **Companion** weapon ability, where X is determined by the current battle round as follows:


**Battle Round 1:** 9&quot;
**Battle Round 2:** 12&quot;
**Battle Round 3:** 15&quot;
**Battle Round 4:** 18&quot;
**Battle Round 5:** 21&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6f47-50f1-1e37-8e67" name="Fane of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Uncategorized" id="4uwgds7" primary="false" entryId="(No Category)" /><category name="Configuration" id="4vmk7j8" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="4vh7ak" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="cpsoiz" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="cqvfg68" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="1zvs1ku" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="1q4iyj" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="afdb-68a1-283e-3bf2" catalogueRevision="34" catalogueName="Hedonites of Slaanesh"><selections><selection id="ne9qohs" name="Exalted Chariot" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::08e6-7dfb-f60e-6fc0" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="aac7-799b-b28e-2190" name="Exalted Chariot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">9</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e5cf-5a69-cd18-5649" name="Excess of Blades" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the unmodified charge roll for that **^^Charge^^** ability. For each roll that exceeds the target's Save characteristic, the target suffers 1 mortal damage.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="nfkenia" name="Exalted Chariot" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::ab60-d913-fb45-0775" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ng3ab0i" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::76e9-71da-06c5-3ac2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ab85-0854-d758-52c0" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ng6pn9" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" entryId="9001-8978-4c6f-601e::e8d7-b59b-871c-3ae5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bca3-b168-e166-8ff5" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="(No Category)" entryId="(No Category)" name="Uncategorized" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="ofmvlrb" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Exalted Chariot" entryId="8fb0-25a8-5bd2-4d01::95eb-6e32-fd0f-7b39" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="b86f-a293-9fd7-7f08" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Exalted Chariot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b6c5-d7db-cdde-9884" name="Soulgorgers" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 visible friendly non-**^^Unique Hedonites of Slaanesh War Machines^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the targets' melee weapons for the rest of the turn. This ability also affects **Companion** weapons.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2227-a3c3-63a4-efdf" name="Mutilating Blades" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ogvai2" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Exalted Chariot" entryId="8fb0-25a8-5bd2-4d01::4ed0-f85f-9e3-e2bb" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="onwqy3n" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" entryId="8fb0-25a8-5bd2-4d01::562f-609f-ce0c-17ed" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="221c-4f94-91d2-f5b2" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ondgr38" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" entryId="8fb0-25a8-5bd2-4d01::ff7c-2782-44a7-6013" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="569b-505f-7ba6-18f2" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="nnfqq9" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Hellflayer" entryId="e3d9-a963-625b-cc36::5c8d-d6ce-1035-6969" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="33b4-3d1a-b21c-ede1" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Hellflayer" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="fd0c-e7ec-0cf0-8a45" name="Slavering for Sensation" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 2 friendly **Hellflayer** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 2&quot; to the Move characteristic of this unit and each target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="f7cf-80e8-902d-e297" name="Soulscent" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 enemy units that this unit passed across this phase to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. If any models are slain by this ability, this unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="eeee-9aa0-8466-5b42" name="Threshing Doom" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">When this unit moves, it can pass through models in enemy **^^Infantry^^** units and can pass through the combat ranges of enemy **^^Infantry^^** units, but it cannot end a move in combat unless specified in the ability used.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="nowpt1k" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Hellflayer" entryId="e3d9-a963-625b-cc36::c40c-9efc-82fa-e403" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="nty6tzl" name="Axle Blades" entryId="e3d9-a963-625b-cc36::1f0d-951d-a341-d4a5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="01a6-b567-b63b-53ac" name="Axle Blades" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Infantry^^** (+1 Rend), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="nto4mmk" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" entryId="e3d9-a963-625b-cc36::0e04-3f4b-c799-696b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="11dc-e28c-1eb2-fa28" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ntuvnbb" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" entryId="e3d9-a963-625b-cc36::9f2d-9331-ec8f-2a88" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3ebb-aec2-e31a-8805" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="o5yh7r" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Seeker Chariot" entryId="79d9-f325-d2c0-538b::1ad6-bbe6-59c2-0716" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e189-0385-4553-5536" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Seeker Chariot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="fb00-3973-b1ea-7e07" name="Thrillseeking Cavalcade" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly **Seeker Chariot** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to charge rolls for this unit and the targets for the rest of the turn. In addition, for the rest of the turn, when this unit and the targets use the 'Mutilating Blades' ability, add 1 to the amount of mortal damage inflicted (if any).</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="21d0-34da-4788-3712" name="Mutilating Blades" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="o5x9o8m" name="Bladebringer, Herald on Seeker Chariot" entryId="79d9-f325-d2c0-538b::f8ad-58b4-8ce9-b510" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="od4gy9f" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" entryId="79d9-f325-d2c0-538b::e4f5-7f18-022a-9bc6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6b96-bad3-3be0-d1e9" name="Flensing Whips and Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="odjq0ls" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" entryId="79d9-f325-d2c0-538b::59cf-e553-17f5-11db" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4a99-c44b-d10e-b41f" name="Steeds' Poisoned Tongues" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="oy6r7i" name="Contorted Epitome" entryId="fc94-72c-a558-c907::7ff4-32c2-f67e-5476" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="83b6-1839-b8f7-5126" name="Contorted Epitome" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">9&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d37d-46f3-9bc9-0f75" name="The Mirror's Depths" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Enemy Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is within 6&quot; of this unit, the target is **gazing into eternity** until the start of your next turn. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, the target is **gazing into eternity** until the start of your next turn.


While the target is **gazing into eternity**, it must end all moves no further from this unit than it was at the start of the move and it cannot be removed from the battlefield by an ability that would allow it to be set up again on the battlefield.


**Designer's Note:** *This includes pile-in moves.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2819-fbe5-f4b6-d237" name="Swallow Energy" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible **^^Manifestation^^** within 12&quot; of this unit and that was not summoned this turn to be the target, then make a banishment roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the banishment roll equals or exceeds the banishment value on the target's warscroll, it is banished and removed from play.


The next time a visible friendly unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit uses a **^^Summon^^** ability, roll an additional D6, to a maximum of 3, when making the casting roll for that ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="oz48dz7" name="Contorted Epitome" entryId="fc94-72c-a558-c907::db0f-33b1-7429-f65c" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="p5fjfej" name="Piercing Claws and Coiled Tentacles" entryId="fc94-72c-a558-c907::8da1-842f-fe5c-7d55" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="62a0-8db8-4df9-e06d" name="Piercing Claws and Coiled Tentacles" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="150" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="f99f-98ee-909f-57cd" name="WARD (4+)" entryId="f99f-98ee-909f-57cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="pl8ttag" name="Dexcessa, the Talon of Slaanesh" entryId="fa3c-59e-ef8e-d133::7c43-7c1e-d92c-f199" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="33fa-e63b-972e-b465" name="Joyous Battle Fury" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any enemy models were slain by this unit's combat attacks this turn, **Heal (D3)** this unit, and add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Impaling Talons** for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ae1f-40ce-28a6-4ba0" name="Dexcessa, the Talon of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="376b-72a-a3ac-faa8" name="Redolence of Violence" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. If this unit charged this turn, add 2 to the roll. If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, 1 model in the target is automatically slain. If the target is a **^^Manifestation^^** and the roll exceeds its banishment value, it is banished.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e38f-3ebf-80ca-50cc" name="Fleeting Dance of Death" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it is in combat.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="f1eb-18bc-1827-e173" name="Scion of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** Ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **^^Paragon^^** that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range and visible to this unit to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="pmv26e" name="Dexcessa, the Talon of Slaanesh" entryId="fa3c-59e-ef8e-d133::73a3-a7ef-a34d-adb9" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="poqy9w" name="Impaling Talons" entryId="fa3c-59e-ef8e-d133::b78e-152c-3d2d-74f9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4b9b-1852-8949-740f" name="Impaling Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">**Charge (+1 Damage)**</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="280" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="pwf4rh" name="Glutos Orscollion, Lord of Gluttony" entryId="e6cc-9cda-6e08-4921::fac2-b0a0-feec-f70f" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2356-acea-ac09-3a24" name="Glutos Orscollion, Lord of Gluttony" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">18</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="437b-af31-be16-73ff" name="Gorge on Excess" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Enemy Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (6)** the target or return a number of slain models to the target with a combined Health characteristic of up to 3.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Rally</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c8a2-0759-eba5-ebfa" name="Paragon Of Gluttony" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following delicacies for Glutos to savour. You cannot pick a delicacy that you picked in the previous turn. The effect applies for the rest of the turn.


***Hear of a Shadow Daemon:*** While they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, friendly non-**^^Monster Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units are not visible to enemy units more than 12&quot; from them.


***Blood of an Aelven Princeling:*** Each time a friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit uses a **^^Run^^** ability if you  roll a 1-3 when determining the diistance that unit can move, you can use a value of 4 instead.


***Crushed Incarnate's Core:*** Add 1 to unbinding rolls and banishment rolls for this unit.


***Unspeakable Viscera:*** Inflict D6 mortal damage on each other unit (friendly and enemy) within this unit's combat range.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="28b9-9c9b-3e06-d093" name="Crippling Famishment" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• Halve the target's Move characteristic.
• Halve run rolls and charge rolls for the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Movement</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="8dce-246a-9a52-2f1f" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Kyazu's Greatblade and Mutants' Claws** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="pxmmg09" name="Glutos Orscollion, Lord of Gluttony" entryId="e6cc-9cda-6e08-4921::eb67-8aa-9f1b-f683" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="pz7b75" name="Glutos's Choking Tentacles" entryId="e6cc-9cda-6e08-4921::9b99-2589-cbd0-ac3b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1806-b186-b701-8531" name="Glutos's Choking Tentacles" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="pz19hb7" name="Kyazu's Greatblade and Mutants' Claws" entryId="e6cc-9cda-6e08-4921::2aff-b1ef-a37-346e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="28a1-e487-2f7e-a841" name="Kyazu's Greatblade and Mutants' Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="pzt5is" name="Leerstave of Loth'shar" entryId="e6cc-9cda-6e08-4921::1fe1-6e73-10df-192b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="b1cd-c6d0-cd3b-2ba6" name="Leerstave of Loth'shar" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="460" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" name="SYBARITE" entryId="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" primary="false" /><category id="6682-0010-2bd3-dc9d" name="PARAGON" entryId="6682-0010-2bd3-dc9d" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="qaxrt8" name="Infernal Enrapturess, Herald of Slaanesh" entryId="b2ba-e9f5-44b1-5b29::37ec-d134-cffd-d637" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3eed-a3d4-a814-af90" name="Infernal Enrapturess, Herald of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8fd4-0134-cc42-67ff" name="Spell-Shredding Symphony" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit can use **^^Unbind^^** and **^^Banish^^** abilities as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**. In addition, each time this unit successfully unbinds a spell, inflict D3 mortal damage on the caster and each time this unit successfully banishes a **^^Manifestation^^**, inflict D3 mortal damage on the unit that summoned that **^^Manifestation^^**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="376c-7cab-2591-6ccc" name="Maestros Of Discordance" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the enemy target. Then, you can pick another visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the friendly target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the number of models in the enemy target unit. For each 6, inflict 1 mortal damage on the enemy target.


Then, you can pick 1 of the following effects:
• **Heal (X)** the friendly target, where X is the number of enemy models slain by this ability this phase.
• Return a number of slain models to the friendly target unit with a total Health characteristic equal to or less than the number of enemy models slain by this ability this phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="qb9xa6v" name="Infernal Enrapturess, Herald of Slaanesh" entryId="b2ba-e9f5-44b1-5b29::d2b9-b2b8-8221-dff" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="qilssti" name="Piercing Claw" entryId="b2ba-e9f5-44b1-5b29::9f9e-7b03-a980-25b1" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8b7d-6fad-143-5b42" name="Piercing Claw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="qtno5u5" name="Infernal Enrapturess, Herald of Slaanesh (Scourge of Aqshy)" entryId="1ad9-5b84-9e8a-62c2::53d4-7622-559f-b128" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7c41-157a-feaf-61d6" name="Infernal Enrapturess, Herald of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="61c8-6dc4-88e4-525f" name="Delightful Defeatism" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, your opponent must make 3 fewer rally rolls of D6.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="db20-0dcd-0c64-ec1c" name="Like Nails on a Chalkboard" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared the 'Eruption of Fury' ability for a unit within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You and your opponent must roll off. If you roll higher, pick another unit (friendly or enemy) within the combat range of the enemy unit using the 'Eruption of Fury' ability. That unit is now the target of that 'Eruption of Fury' ability. Your opponent must spend as many **rage dice** as possible as part of that ability, to a maximum of 3.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="qux8ta" name="Infernal Enrapturess, Herald of Slaanesh" entryId="1ad9-5b84-9e8a-62c2::8ed6-4fa2-1d97-e67b" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="r14dd2q" name="Piercing Claw" entryId="1ad9-5b84-9e8a-62c2::3f9c-901c-b804-8ef6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cfc7-783a-4e4b-717f" name="Piercing Claw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="90" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="rcp1l" name="Keeper of Secrets" entryId="4dd8-2eb6-1e7d-ba23::4011-5d78-a180-3c22" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3202-5f34-c593-6008" name="Locus of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit that started the battle with 3 or more models and has been destroyed to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="295f-da80-a5bf-44e8" name="Keeper of Secrets" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">16</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="fac7-e6a2-3799-be9d" name="Dark Temptations" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following musks. Its effects apply for the rest of the turn.



***Alluring Musk:***
• This unit's weapons have **Crit (2 Hits)** for attacks that target that enemy unit.
• Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by that enemy unit that target this unit.


***Psychotropic Musk:***
• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks made by that enemy unit that target this unit.
• Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of this units melee weapons.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ef74-ce62-b83d-127f" name="Supernatural Grace" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1bff-adc2-c078-9207" name="Cacophonic Choir" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick any number of visible enemy units within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets, then make a casting roll of 2D6. Subtract 1 from the casting roll for each target you picked after the first.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Inflict D3 mortal damage on each target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="32e1-9355-edf-c70" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Elegant Greatblade** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rdyk4pu" name="Keeper of Secrets" entryId="4dd8-2eb6-1e7d-ba23::aee0-9dc5-ffd0-8b2a" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rkn9k3r" name="Elegant Greatblade" entryId="4dd8-2eb6-1e7d-ba23::ea65-458f-a4c2-2040" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="976d-26bb-1caa-33fa" name="Elegant Greatblade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rk0ji5v" name="Impaling Claws" entryId="4dd8-2eb6-1e7d-ba23::6fd-4e16-ac1a-934c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="675d-5199-663-54fa" name="Impaling Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="420" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="rxvox7" name="Lord of Hubris" entryId="e120-58a7-b8ef-ab66::ef1b-a791-66b4-735f" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3f88-1bd6-66c1-5c5d" name="Lord of Hubris" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="803d-7041-688b-7465" name="'You First, I Insist...'" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Your opponent must decide whether the target will **accept** or **decline** this unit's challenge.


If they **accept**, for the rest of the turn, if this unit is in combat with the target when the target is picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks and all of the target's attacks must target this unit.


If they **decline**, for the rest of the turn:
• The target has **^^Strike-last^^**.
• Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for attacks that target that enemy unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3e43-f999-e8a0-ecd0" name="Allow Me To Demonstrate" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Sybarite^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by this unit and the target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ryypidm" name="Lord of Hubris" entryId="e120-58a7-b8ef-ab66::40d7-2f23-9a21-7c01" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="s5k2x" name="Exquisite Scimitar" entryId="e120-58a7-b8ef-ab66::1725-5e7b-8731-d9c9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4d78-78ff-fb74-b49f" name="Exquisite Scimitar" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" name="SYBARITE" entryId="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="siw0z3m" name="Lord of Hysteria" entryId="d1ea-0fe5-a06b-ed16::1d30-89fa-6fba-3df7" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="dcef-5130-ead1-4e4c" name="Lord of Hysteria" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a1da-99a4-9f4a-826b" name="Slaughterous Celebrants" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While they are wholly within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit, melee weapons used by friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Infantry^^** units have **Anti-charge (+1 Rend)**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="761b-b083-2a1b-3dc8" name="Master Of The Revels" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn, pick a visible friendly **^^Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is a **^^Paragon^^**, apply the following effect to the target. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the following effect to the target:
• For the rest of the turn, while the target is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="sjxmcsg" name="Lord of Hysteria" entryId="d1ea-0fe5-a06b-ed16::3110-a9a9-94fe-f5d5" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="sq0rnhd" name="Ceremonial Weapons" entryId="d1ea-0fe5-a06b-ed16::28c1-196a-0e59-f2a2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="0751-4ce1-e497-4d6d" name="Ceremonial Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" name="SYBARITE" entryId="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="t3aezdg" name="Lord of Pain" entryId="5c9a-9bc-17a5-10c4::4890-8c79-a2bd-b1ad" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cec2-323f-4c69-d16b" name="Lord of Pain" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4dbb-5331-8d9-71f0" name="Share the Pain" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit has **Ward (5+)** while it is in combat. In addition each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit for a damage point inflicted by a combat attack, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ef7f-7fa7-1503-045c" name="Atrocious Ministrations" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can allocate 1 damage point to the target (ward rolls cannot be made for that damage point). Then, roll a dice. On a 3+ until the start of your next turn, the target can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if they used a **^^Run^^** or **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="t35y0tx" name="Lord of Pain" entryId="5c9a-9bc-17a5-10c4::71c5-c6d1-dded-66b1" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="tamnkf" name="Soulpiercer Mace" entryId="5c9a-9bc-17a5-10c4::60b2-99d4-3c64-bb3c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="364b-9ca-2c62-37f3" name="Soulpiercer Mace" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" name="SYBARITE" entryId="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="tozcoe" name="Shalaxi Helbane" entryId="3dc-2b50-5aef-e9d4::288-b306-7776-96b5" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="91a1-6acf-c30f-7da0" name="An Exquisite Trophy" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the phase, the following effects apply:


• This unit's combat attacks that target that enemy unit have **Crit (2 Hits)** and score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.
• If the target is destroyed by this unit's combat attacks this phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons used by other friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="9d6c-f084-7381-a9a7" name="Shalaxi Helbane" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">16</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="67ca-3436-910-c622" name="Paramount Hunter" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Charge^^** ability for a **^^Hero^^** within 12&quot; of this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is not in combat, it can immediately move 2D6&quot;. It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units but it must end that move within 1/2&quot; of that **^^Hero^^**. If it does so, this unit has charged, and that **^^Hero^^**'s **^^Charge^^** ability has no effect.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**, **^^Move^^**, **^^Charge^^**, **^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="bbd0-62b7-cb3a-68a9" name="Supernatural Grace" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn. In addition, no mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5ce3-79b1-1338-f8ec" name="Refine Senses" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible friendly **^^h^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6. Add 1 to the casting roll if this unit is the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has **^^Strike-first^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="bbd4-a864-c34-9fe6" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Soulpiercer** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="to43e6f" name="Shalaxi Helbane" entryId="3dc-2b50-5aef-e9d4::9846-f238-fcdc-ad15" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="tqqvuds" name="Impaling Claws" entryId="3dc-2b50-5aef-e9d4::443a-7539-773b-c04b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="b677-72b0-bde3-79a7" name="Impaling Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tr8jg97" name="Soulpiercer" entryId="3dc-2b50-5aef-e9d4::b859-1a8e-b99b-96d8" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ed01-6a17-ad1f-b376" name="Soulpiercer" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti‑**^^Hero^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="410" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="6682-0010-2bd3-dc9d" name="PARAGON" entryId="6682-0010-2bd3-dc9d" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="u7e659" name="Shardspeaker of Slaanesh" entryId="d62-3e9e-6c66-6e2c::27ef-714f-2f7-3770" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e666-f47e-b166-e0a3" name="Shardspeaker of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c4a7-7d2a-c840-4dc4" name="Truths Of The Twisted Mirror" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">If this unit is a **^^Paragon^^**, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of it to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from save rolls for the targett.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="64ef-3a57-4cb0-71d9" name="Bargain With The Mist-Daemons" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 1, inflict 2 mortal damage on this unit. On a 3+, add 2 to the casting roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="u80f77m" name="Shardspeaker of Slaanesh" entryId="d62-3e9e-6c66-6e2c::2d89-e7a0-73b8-c61d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ue2byjn" name="Haze Staff" entryId="d62-3e9e-6c66-6e2c::b24c-a58f-3c3b-4dfa" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c486-57b0-890b-9260" name="Haze Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" name="SYBARITE" entryId="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="uqgvqb" name="Sigvald, Prince of Slaanesh" entryId="c193-2e94-c3ab-ca05::a172-db1d-3ad4-c354" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c5d6-e3c2-8769-3ff6" name="Sigvald, Prince of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c741-a37c-d1dd-2922" name="Shardslash" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Subtract 1 from ward rolls for damage points inflicted by this unit's combat attacks.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="0f9e-aa28-ddcc-c359" name="Gaze Upon My Magnificence And Weep" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** Ability this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to the the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Your opponent must decide whether the target will **adulate** or **reject** Sigvald.


***Adulate:*** Until the start of your next turn, while the target is in combat with this unit, it tmust pick this unit to be the target of pile-in moves it makes.


***Reject:*** Inflict D3+3 mortal damage on the target, then ***Heal (X)*** this unit, where X is the number of damage points inflicted on the target this turn by this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Temptation^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1a8a-2c96-ca53-2664" name="Paragon Of Vainglory" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit charged this turn and the unmodified charge roll was 6+ for the rest of the turn:


• This unit has **^^Strike-first^^**.
• The Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Shardslash** is equal to the unmodified charge roll.
• Melee weapons, including **Companion** weapons, used by other friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** units have **Crit (2 Hits) while they are wholly within 12&quot; of and visible to this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="urhz448" name="Sigvald, Prince of Slaanesh" entryId="c193-2e94-c3ab-ca05::19d6-6cd3-ca23-249e" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="us55xz" name="Shardslash" entryId="c193-2e94-c3ab-ca05::6924-5205-6a01-f4b2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ce0d-2441-f621-fc70" name="Shardslash" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (2 Hits)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="240" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" name="SYBARITE" entryId="9a4b-cd0b-84e1-16c5" primary="false" /><category id="f99f-98ee-909f-57cd" name="WARD (4+)" entryId="f99f-98ee-909f-57cd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="6682-0010-2bd3-dc9d" name="PARAGON" entryId="6682-0010-2bd3-dc9d" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ooqdd6f" name="Syll'Esske, the Vengeful Allegiance" entryId="de65-6b19-da44-4b2b::89b7-8cfa-f458-12c0" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c6aa-2ba3-b977-1029" name="Syll'Esske, the Vengeful Allegiance" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">9</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">4</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="223b-4fc5-cccf-29ce" name="Champions Of The Gilded Throne" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">When players are alternating picking units to use a **^^Fight^^** ability, when it is your turn to pick a unit, instead of picking 1 unit, you can pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit wholly within 18&quot; of this unit and a friendly non-**^^Hero Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 18&quot; of this unit. Resolve the second **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the first.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="66e8-1e17-328b-1055" name="Unholy Symbiosis" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick up to 1 visible friendly **^^Sybarite^^** unit and up to 1 visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Daemon^^** unit to be the targets, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">If you picked a **^^Sybarite^^** target, subtract 1 from ward rolls for damage points inflicted by its combat attacks until thte start of your next turn. If you picked a **^^Daemon^^** target, it has Ward (5+) until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="c9e4-f438-980c-9272" name="Violent Offerings" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any damage points were allocated this turn by this unit's combat attacks to an enemy **^^Wizard^^**, **^^Priest^^**, **^^Unique^^** unit or unit with an artefact of power, and that enemy unit has been destroyed, add 1 to this unit's power level for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ooleoqd" name="Syll'Esske, the Vengeful Allegiance" entryId="de65-6b19-da44-4b2b::8d4f-1390-6596-ef54" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="oq9wmvh" name="Axe of Dominion" entryId="de65-6b19-da44-4b2b::63fc-cf16-21fe-2041" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9a02-2ce1-227c-e033" name="Axe of Dominion" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="oq2c7t" name="Scourging Whip" entryId="de65-6b19-da44-4b2b::fc7a-cca3-892f-f432" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5423-62a0-2bcf-ee0" name="Scourging Whip" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="250" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ozswba" name="Synessa, the Voice of Slaanesh" entryId="c3d7-ea6c-249e-8e86::eb63-b209-7932-2b43" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8209-3644-0b7c-c1b2" name="Arcane Seductor" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Battle Round</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll is higher than the target's power level, for the rest of the battle round, while the target is within 18&quot; of this unit:
• Subtract 1 from the casting rolls and chanting rolls for enemy units while they are within 18&quot; of this unit.
• Add 1 to this unit's power level.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e97e-9533-7134-6317" name="Synessa, the Voice of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f9b8-cb9-1d14-9e4f" name="Enthralling Splendour" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit with a lower Control characteristic than this unit that charged this turn and is in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7a9a-5e84-438c-46f0" name="Whispers of Desire" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">For the rest of the turn, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ozeur3i" name="Synessa, the Voice of Slaanesh" entryId="c3d7-ea6c-249e-8e86::b259-cb20-eacf-e62d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="p0dbsep" name="Staff of Slaanesh" entryId="c3d7-ea6c-249e-8e86::a297-1781-b89d-594a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c660-1595-9f8e-2162" name="Staff of Slaanesh" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">18&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="p0gfl0b" name="Unraveller's Talons" entryId="c3d7-ea6c-249e-8e86::ab87-8d39-e41b-98c6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2b6e-e89d-3c31-84b3" name="Unraveller's Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="250" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="pk32udf" name="The Masque" entryId="5c24-aded-3430-9992::19fa-187-b059-ffce" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4be4-1dbc-986c-28f2" name="The Endless Dance" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects:


***The Dance of Dreaming:*** Pick a visible enemy unit within 6&quot; of this unit to be the target. For the rest of the turn, if the unmodified hit roll for an attack made by that enemy unit that targets this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.


***The Pavane of Slaanesh:*** This unit can move 2D3&quot;. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units and can end that move in combat.


***The Waltz of Lethargy:*** Pick a visible enemy unit within 6&quot; of this unit to be the target. For the rest of the turn, the target cannot use commands while it is in combat with this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="aabd-e28e-1fbb-609a" name="The Masque" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9e17-8dc9-b594-543b" name="Captive Audience" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Enemy units cannot use **^^Retreat^^** abilities while they are in combat with this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="pko7xjr" name="The Masque" entryId="5c24-aded-3430-9992::e3ed-1397-36a0-7f11" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="pl2igfa" name="Razor-edged Claws" entryId="5c24-aded-3430-9992::1d15-ad9d-ffb-6088" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="11ae-7fd2-845b-465d" name="Razor-edged Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" name="HEDONITES OF SLAANESH" entryId="67df-cdfb-d83f-3197" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="f99f-98ee-909f-57cd" name="WARD (4+)" entryId="f99f-98ee-909f-57cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="pu9gjw" name="Thricefold Discord" entryId="40a1-ecaa-7b30-14a4::2496-8747-e770-79da" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a45c-098d-61cb-49cc" name="Thricefold Discord" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="780e-fdb0-0097-1185" name="Thricefold Court" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects that you did not pick in the previous turn. The effect applies for the rest of the turn:


***Sins of Soul:*** While an enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** is visible to this unit, add 1 to this unit's power level.


***Sins of Flesh:*** This unit's attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.


***Sins of Mind:*** Each time a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you receive 3 additional rally points.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a4f8-80d5-c696-6e36" name="Gifts Of Pain And Pleasure" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick either a visible friendly **^^Hedonites of Slaanesh Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit or a visible enemy unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. Then, make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">If the target is a friendly unit, add 2&quot; to its Move characteristic until the start of your next turn.


If the target is an enemy unit, inflict X mortal damage on it, then **Heal (X)** this unit. X is equal to the number of models in this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="pvczqmc" name="Lascivyr, the Bladed Blessing" entryId="40a1-ecaa-7b30-14a4::a8e6-1aa4-a9d6-7de9" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="q0rac5" name="Carnal Blades and Wicked Claws" entryId="40a1-ecaa-7b30-14a4::84e7-2d94-a362-a268" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ecc9-fa21-1b1e-03a8" name="Carnal Blades and Wicked Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">**Crit (2 Hits)**</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection><selection id="pv9mqos" name="Vashtiss the Coiled" entryId="40a1-ecaa-7b30-14a4::2c28-d41d-2bb7-371a" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="q0vhqc" name="Carnal Blades and Wicked Claws" entryId="40a1-ecaa-7b30-14a4::aced-16fb-3dec-dbfb" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8504-af91-9144-82ce" name="Carnal Blades and Wicked Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-3