ic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit charged this turn, it can move D3+3&quot;. It can pass through enemy models and the combat ranges of enemy units but must end that move within 1/2&quot; of a visible enemy unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rjwulrn" name="Daemonette" entryId="8f2a-872-df1d-6c55::c170-a7c9-3bd5-20e2" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rj32xp" name="Piercing Claws" entryId="8f2a-872-df1d-6c55::c893-1604-484b-54db" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="49fe-9355-b67-190a" name="Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anit-**Infantry** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rkzzgea" name="Champion" entryId="8f2a-872-df1d-6c55::588f-afb-c09b-59c4::9c21-1746-9873-a5b5" entryGroupId="8f2a-872-df1d-6c55::1762-f2e3-e4ce-9ff9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Command Models"><profiles><profile id="cfed-845b-b46c-fc6d" name="Champion" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of weapons used by champions in this unit. If this unit is a **^^Beast^^**, this ability affects this unit's **Companion** weapons.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" name="Command Model" entryId="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections></selection><selection id="rmhm1co" name="Daemonette" entryId="8f2a-872-df1d-6c55::c170-a7c9-3bd5-20e2" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rn23zqg" name="Piercing Claws" entryId="8f2a-872-df1d-6c55::c893-1604-484b-54db" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="49fe-9355-b67-190a" name="Piercing Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from=